  "text_md": "## Birmingham Public Schools, MI\n\n## Math Performance by Subgroup, Grades 3-8, 2019-2023\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Reading Performance by Subgroup, Grades 3-8, 2019-2023\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Average Math Scores and Trends in Scores\n\nin Grade Level Equivalents Relative to the 2019\n\nNational Average\n\n|                  |   Black | Hispanic   |   White |   Poor |   Non-Poor |\n|------------------|---------|------------|---------|--------|------------|\n| 2019 Average     |   -0.26 | N/A        |    2.06 |  -0.21 |       2.04 |\n| 2022 Average     |   -0.65 | N/A        |    2.01 |  -0.42 |       2.01 |\n| 2023 Average     |   -0.16 | N/A        |    2.35 |  -0.26 |       2.37 |\n| 2019-2022 Change |   -0.39 | N/A        |   -0.05 |  -0.21 |      -0.03 |\n| 2022-2023 Change |   +0.49 | N/A        |   +0.34 |  +0.16 |      +0.36 |\n| 2019-2023 Change |   +0.10 | N/A        |   +0.29 |  -0.05 |      +0.33 |\n\n## Average Reading Scores and Trends in Scores\n\nin Grade Level Equivalents Relative to the 2019\n\nNational Average\n\n|                  |   Black | Hispanic   |   White |   Poor |   Non-Poor |\n|------------------|---------|------------|---------|--------|------------|\n| 2019 Average     |    0.31 | N/A        |    2.17 |   0.23 |       2.16 |\n| 2022 Average     |   -0.09 | N/A        |    2.21 |   0.21 |       2.19 |\n| 2023 Average     |    0.36 | N/A        |    2.43 |   0.34 |       2.43 |\n| 2019-2022 Change |   -0.39 | N/A        |   +0.04 |  -0.03 |      +0.03 |\n| 2022-2023 Change |   +0.44 | N/A        |   +0.22 |  +0.13 |      +0.24 |\n| 2019-2023 Change |   +0.05 | N/A        |   +0.26 |  +0.11 |      +0.26 |\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->",
